{"id":"69fd12190649a7f7","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-residuated.md","title":"Residuated Lattice","display":"df-residuated — Residuated Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-residuated","aliases":["93-df-residuated"],"display":"df-residuated — Residuated Lattice","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-residuated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-residuated</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-residuated — Residuated Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf R\">\\(\\mathbf R\\)</span> is an algebra candidate with prospective symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\cdot,\\backslash,/,e\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\cdot,\\backslash,/,e\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> are the predicates, nullary-value constructor, and classes of the cited definitions.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\mathbf R^-\">\\(S_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\mathbf R^-\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\cdot,\\backslash,/,e\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\cdot,\\backslash,/,e\\)</span> 是固定且两两不同的运算符号；它们在所有引用本签名的文件中保持同一符号身份。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf R^-\">\\(\\mathbf R^-\\)</span> 的构造定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}}(\\mathbf R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}}(\\mathbf R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf R)\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf R)\\)</span> 只在该类型下使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf{RL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\cdot,\\backslash,/,e\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\wedge,2\\rangle,\\langle \\vee,2\\rangle,\\langle \\cdot,2\\rangle,\\langle \\backslash,2\\rangle,\\langle /,2\\rangle,\\langle e,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf{RL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\cdot,\\backslash,/,e\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\wedge,2\\rangle,\\langle \\vee,2\\rangle,\\langle \\cdot,2\\rangle,\\langle \\backslash,2\\rangle,\\langle /,2\\rangle,\\langle e,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\n\\mathbf R^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf R|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf R},\\vee^{\\mathbf R}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\n\\mathbf R^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf R|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf R},\\vee^{\\mathbf R}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}}(\\mathbf R)\\land\\mathbf R^-\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf R|\\;\\Bigl[\n(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}b)\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}c\n=a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}(b\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf R)=a\n\\land\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf R)\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}a=a\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl(\na\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}b\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}c\n\\leftrightarrow b\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}a\\backslash^{\\mathbf R}c\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}b\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}c\n\\leftrightarrow a\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}c/^{\\mathbf R}b\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ResLat}_{93}(\\mathbf R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}}(\\mathbf R)\\land\\mathbf R^-\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf R|\\;\\Bigl[\n(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}b)\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}c\n=a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}(b\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf R)=a\n\\land\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf R)\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}a=a\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl(\na\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}b\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}c\n\\leftrightarrow b\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}a\\backslash^{\\mathbf R}c\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf R}b\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}c\n\\leftrightarrow a\\leq_{\\mathbf R^-}c/^{\\mathbf R}b\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residuated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf{RL}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{RL}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Residuated lattices are genuine algebras of the sourced type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{RL}}\\)</span>, which makes congruence and commutator calls well-typed. The monoid unit is the value extracted from the nullary operation graph; both residuals are retained.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":fal